SUMMARY:Mix\, Mingle and Canada vs Switzerland! (World Cup Soccer 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nPlease join
  us for a great day as we mix\, mingle and enjoy **Team Canada in World Cu
 p Soccer!**\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticip
 ate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and th
 e game\n\n**\\*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 3:00 pm and 4:00 pm**\n\n
 \\* The match starts at 3:00 pm\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\
 nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**Mix\, Mingle and C
 anada vs Switzerland! (World Cup Soccer 2026)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, 
 event with friends\, food and the Canadian Men's World Cup Soccer match ag
 ainst Qatar (Lots of Big Screen TV's to catch the game)\n-Pool Table\, and
  food specials too\n-Plenty of parking all around the venue\n\n**Friendly 
 Reminders:**\n-Arrive any time between 3:00 pm and 4:00 pm inside the rest
 aurant (ask or look for Steve/Organizer when you arrive)\n(1 minute walk f
 rom the new Eglinton station at Mt. Pleasant-or simply take bus or uber fr
 om the station)\n\n-Plenty of parking all around the venue and very close 
 to Mt. Pleasant Station\n\n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (cash only) when you 
 arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gma
 il.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Min
 imum please to support the staff and restaurant)\n\\*Plan to join us for d
 inner and the game!
