SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs and Stories that Stir the Soul
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us
  for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs and Stories that Sti
 r the Soul.**\nSong with heart\; written and produced by yours truly.\n\nD
 o you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful songwriting\n* Folk music and country st
 orytelling\n* Life reflection and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help us 
 understand ourselves a little better\n\nIf so\, you have come to the right
  place :)\n\nThese are songs about ordinary people\, extraordinary moments
 \, beautiful imagery\, and the search for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welc
 ome to join us any time starting at 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Detail
 s below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Arti
 st)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Stev
 e Flemming Presents: Songs and Stories that Stir the Soul**\n**(on Zoom)**
 \n\nJoin a thoughtful observer of life who has spent decades turning exper
 iences\, questions\, and realizations into stories\, poems and songs. Toge
 ther may we feel understood\, less alone and truly seen.\n\n**Songs contai
 ning:**\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine craftsma
 nship\n\n**Songs that ask the questions**\n\n* What makes a good life?\n* 
 What makes a good person?\n* What causes us to lose ourselves?\n* What hel
 ps us find ourselves again?\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming 
 is a prolific folk-country singer-songwriter whose songs explore ordinary 
 people\, gratitude\, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the
  search for meaning.\n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis
  songs explore freedom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple
  wisdom hidden in ordinary life\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\
 n\n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer
  or pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contri
 bute is greatly appreciated to help support these wonderful intimate eveni
 ngs among music lovers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoo
 m.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-
