SUMMARY:The Pizza and Burger Summer Patio Dinner Party
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'd like to in
 vite you out to our **Pizza and Burger Summer Patio Dinner Party!**\n\n-Re
 served seating\, friendly people\, good conversation and great food awaits
 !\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we can anticipate a fabul
 ous turn out!*\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, June 28th\n**Arrival Time:** Please a
 rrive between 6:30 p.m. -7:00 p.m.\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** S
 moke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential
  area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and M
